summary:
  The watch is not told that a pause holds the station.

history:
  Whatever silences a station by the listener's own hand must not be read
  as a death: a park woken by a recovery road is the report issue #13 was
  about. The player is stopped under a park, and the watch is told of the
  park as well, so that it does not depend on that alone.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandWatch.qml

find:
  parked: app._tsPaused,

replace:
  parked: false,

expect:
  Killed by tst_standwatch::test_what_is_not_the_broadcast_stops_the_timer.
  Line-neutral.
